      "message": "Why are you adding the BazelConversionStatus here when in the previous cl you didn\u0027t update any other module types to add BazelConversionStatus?\n\nI\u0027m also confused because I thought the point of adding BazelConversionStatus was so that it\u0027s fields don\u0027t show up as properties in an Android.bp file.",
